":"Breath Weapon","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The iron golem exhales poisonous gas in a @Template[burst|distance:10]{10-foot radius} centered on the corner of one of the iron golem's squares.</p>\n<p>The gas persists for 1 round. Any creature in the area (or that later enters the area) is exposed to the iron golem's poison.</p>\n<p>The golem can't use its Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!xmYBnii6XuByAUZx.UxbAHJiUJAsFm4cq"},{"_id":"x8bFDzkhGGqdhVb2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Inexorable March","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The iron golem Strides up to its Speed, pushing back each creature whose space it moves into and damaging them if they try to stop its movement. A creature can attempt to bar the way by succeeding at a @Check[fortitude|dc:39|traits:damaging-effect] save. On a critical success, the resisting creature takes no damage; otherwise, it is damaged as if hit by the golem's fist.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!xmYBnii6XuByAUZx.x8bFDzkhGGqdhVb2"},{"_id":"Y0ySCcnmHvN9oQCd","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Iron Golem Poison","sort":800000,"sys